  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --blue: #2563eb;
      --blue-dark: #1d4ed8;
      --purple: #7c3aed;
      --ink: #172033;
      --muted: #64748b;
      --line: #e5eaf2;
      --bg: #f7f9fc;
      --soft-blue: #eff6ff;
      --soft-purple: #f5f0ff;
      --green: #087f5b;
      --red: #b42318;
      --radius: 16px;
      --shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(31, 41, 55, .06);
      --accent: #3157d5;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      scroll-padding-top: 90px;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    button, input, select, textarea {
      font: inherit;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--blue);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      color: var(--blue-dark);
    }

    button:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible,
    select:focus-visible,
    textarea:focus-visible,
    a:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #93c5fd;
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    button:disabled {
      opacity: .5;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p {
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    /* Header */

    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .97);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      min-height: 70px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
    }

    .brand:hover {
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .brand-icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 39px;
      height: 39px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), var(--purple));
    }

    .brand-name span {
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .main-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .main-nav a {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .main-nav a:hover,
    .main-nav a.active {
      background: var(--soft-blue);
      color: var(--blue-dark);
    }

    /* Hero */

    .breadcrumb {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      padding-top: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .breadcrumb a {
      color: #52627a;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 38px 8px 27px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--soft-blue);
      color: var(--blue-dark);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: .6px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--purple);
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 auto 13px;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 47px);
      line-height: 1.16;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      color: var(--blue);
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--blue), var(--purple));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 730px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* Builder layout */

    .builder-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .editor-card,
    .preview-shell {
      min-width: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .editor-card {
      padding: 23px;
    }

    .editor-heading {
      margin-bottom: 21px;
    }

    .editor-heading h2 {
      margin: 0 0 5px;
      font-size: 21px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
    }

    .editor-heading p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .section-heading {
      margin: 24px 0 13px;
      padding-bottom: 9px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .section-heading:first-of-type {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .field {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .field.full {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .field label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .field input,
    .field select,
    .field textarea {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 42px;
      padding: 9px 10px;
      border: 1px solid #d7dfeb;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .field textarea {
      min-height: 80px;
      resize: vertical;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .field input:focus,
    .field select:focus,
    .field textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--blue);
    }

    .field input[aria-invalid="true"] {
      border-color: var(--red);
      background: #fff7f7;
    }

    .help {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .logo-upload {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 13px;
      border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fbfdff;
    }

    .logo-thumbnail {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      overflow: hidden;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .logo-thumbnail img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .logo-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
    }

    .hidden-file {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
      clip-path: inset(50%);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .field-hint {
      margin: 7px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    /* Invoice lines editor */

    .items-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin: 23px 0 11px;
    }

    .items-heading h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .items-table-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }

    .items-table {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 450px;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .items-table th {
      padding: 9px 7px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #475569;
      text-align: left;
      white-space: nowrap;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .items-table td {
      padding: 7px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    .items-table input {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 55px;
      min-height: 36px;
      padding: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #d7dfeb;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .items-table .item-description {
      min-width: 120px;
    }

    .items-table .item-quantity {
      min-width: 55px;
    }

    .items-table .item-price {
      min-width: 82px;
    }

    .line-amount {
      padding-top: 9px;
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 750;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .remove-item {
      min-height: 31px;
      padding: 5px 7px;
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--red);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .remove-item:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: #fef2f2;
    }

    /* Buttons */

    .button-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 7px;
      min-height: 40px;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 9px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 850;
      transition: background .18s, border-color .18s, transform .18s;
    }

    .button:hover:not(:disabled) {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(110deg, var(--blue), var(--purple));
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(79, 70, 229, .15);
    }

    .button-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
      color: white;
      opacity: .95;
    }

    .button-secondary {
      border-color: #dbe2ec;
      background: white;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .button-secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {
      border-color: #94a3b8;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .feedback {
      margin-top: 13px;
      padding: 11px 13px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .feedback:empty {
      display: none;
    }

    .feedback.error {
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
      background: #fef2f2;
      color: var(--red);
    }

    .feedback.success {
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      background: #f0fdf4;
      color: #166534;
    }

    .feedback.info {
      border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
      background: var(--soft-blue);
      color: var(--blue-dark);
    }

    /* Preview panel */

    .preview-shell {
      position: sticky;
      top: 91px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .preview-toolbar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 14px 17px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fff;
    }

    .preview-toolbar strong {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .preview-toolbar span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .preview-status {
      padding: 10px 17px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fffbeb;
      color: #92400e;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .preview-status[hidden] {
      display: none;
    }

    .preview-padding {
      padding: 19px;
      background: #f0f3f9;
    }

    /* The invoice paper */

    .invoice-paper {
      --invoice-accent: #3157d5;
      padding: 28px 25px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #172033;
      border: 1px solid #e3e8f0;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(31, 41, 55, .05);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .invoice-paper h2,
    .invoice-paper h3,
    .invoice-paper p {
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .invoice-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 13px;
      padding-bottom: 23px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--invoice-accent);
    }

    .invoice-brand-block {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .invoice-logo {
      display: block;
      max-width: 125px;
      max-height: 60px;
      object-fit: contain;
      object-position: left center;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .invoice-seller-name {
      margin: 0 0 3px;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .invoice-seller-details {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 10px;
      white-space: pre-line;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .invoice-title-block {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .invoice-document-title {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--invoice-accent);
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 850;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .invoice-number {
      margin-top: 7px;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .invoice-meta {
      margin-top: 3px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .invoice-parties {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 17px;
      padding: 21px 0;
    }

    .invoice-party-label {
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: var(--invoice-accent);
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: .6px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .invoice-party-name {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .invoice-party-details {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }

    .invoice-items {
      width: 100%;
      margin: 2px 0 0;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      table-layout: fixed;
    }

    .invoice-items th {
      padding: 10px 6px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dbe2ec;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 850;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .invoice-items td {
      padding: 10px 6px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f5;
      vertical-align: top;
      font-size: 10px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .invoice-items th:nth-child(1) {
      width: 48%;
    }

    .invoice-items th:nth-child(2) {
      width: 13%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .invoice-items th:nth-child(3),
    .invoice-items th:nth-child(4) {
      text-align: right;
    }

    .invoice-items td:nth-child(2) {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .invoice-items td:nth-child(3),
    .invoice-items td:nth-child(4) {
      text-align: right;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .invoice-item-description {
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .invoice-totals-wrap {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      margin-top: 19px;
    }

    .invoice-totals {
      width: min(100%, 270px);
    }

    .invoice-total-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 13px;
      padding: 5px 0;
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .invoice-total-row span:last-child {
      text-align: right;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .invoice-total-row.grand-total {
      margin-top: 7px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid #dbe2ec;
      color: var(--invoice-accent);
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .invoice-total-row.balance {
      padding: 10px 11px;
      margin-top: 9px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: #f0f4ff;
      color: var(--invoice-accent);
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .invoice-subsection {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-top: 13px;
      border-top: 1px solid #edf0f5;
    }

    .invoice-subsection h3 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .invoice-subsection p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 10px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }

    .invoice-footer {
      margin-top: 27px;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #edf0f5;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 9px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Learning sections */

    .content-section {
      padding-top: 53px;
    }

    .section-title {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 32px);
      line-height: 1.3;
      letter-spacing: -.8px;
    }

    .section-lead {
      max-width: 790px;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .info-card {
      padding: 21px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: white;
    }

    .info-icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: var(--soft-blue);
      color: var(--blue-dark);
    }

    .info-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .info-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .formula-panel {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 23px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: white;
    }

    .formula-panel h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .formula-panel p {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: #52627a;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .formula {
      display: block;
      margin: 12px 0;
      padding: 13px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: #334155;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    /* FAQs */

    .faq-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 21px;
    }

    .faq-item {
      padding: 19px 21px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: white;
    }

    .faq-item h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .faq-item p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    /* Footer */

    .site-footer {
      margin-top: 57px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: white;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 30px;
      padding-top: 29px;
      padding-bottom: 27px;
    }

    .footer-about {
      max-width: 540px;
    }

    .footer-about p {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .footer-nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px 18px;
      padding-top: 8px;
    }

    .footer-nav a {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      padding: 15px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-bottom p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .builder-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .preview-shell {
        position: static;
      }

      .preview-padding {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .invoice-paper {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding: 35px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .editor-card {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .info-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .container {
        width: calc(100% - 26px);
      }

      .header-inner {
        min-height: 63px;
        gap: 6px;
      }

      .brand {
        gap: 6px;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: -.3px;
      }

      .brand-icon {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
      }

      .main-nav {
        gap: 0;
      }

      .main-nav a {
        padding: 7px;
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .breadcrumb {
        padding-top: 18px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 31px 3px 25px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
        letter-spacing: -1.1px;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .editor-card {
        padding: 16px 12px;
        border-radius: 15px;
      }

      .editor-heading h2 {
        font-size: 19px;
      }

      .form-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .field.full {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .button-row .button {
        flex: 1 1 auto;
      }

      .preview-padding {
        padding: 10px;
      }

      .invoice-paper {
        padding: 18px 12px;
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .invoice-document-title {
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      .invoice-seller-name {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .invoice-parties {
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .invoice-items th,
      .invoice-items td {
        padding: 7px 4px;
        font-size: 9px;
      }

      .invoice-items th:nth-child(1) {
        width: 43%;
      }

      .invoice-items th:nth-child(2) {
        width: 14%;
      }

      .invoice-items td:nth-child(3),
      .invoice-items td:nth-child(4) {
        white-space: normal;
      }

      .invoice-total-row {
        font-size: 9px;
      }

      .invoice-total-row.grand-total {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .content-section {
        padding-top: 42px;
      }

      .formula-panel,
      .faq-item {
        padding: 17px;
      }
    }

    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 12mm;
    }

    @media print {
      body {
        background: white;
        color: #111;
      }

      .site-header,
      .breadcrumb,
      .hero,
      .editor-card,
      .preview-toolbar,
      .preview-status,
      .content-section,
      .site-footer {
        display: none !important;
      }

      .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: none;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .builder-grid {
        display: block;
      }

      .preview-shell {
        display: block;
        position: static;
        overflow: visible;
        border: none;
        box-shadow: none;
        background: white;
      }

      .preview-column {
        display: block;
      }

      .preview-padding {
        padding: 0;
        background: white;
      }

      .invoice-paper {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: none;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        border: none;
        box-shadow: none;
        font-size: 10pt;
      }

      .invoice-items tr,
      .invoice-totals-wrap,
      .invoice-top,
      .invoice-parties,
      .invoice-subsection {
        break-inside: avoid;
      }

      .invoice-paper,
      .invoice-paper * {
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        print-color-adjust: exact;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto;
      }

      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        transition-duration: .01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="ConvertToToolsOnline homepage">
        <span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <path d="M4 7H14M11 4L14 7L11 10"
              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M20 17H10M13 14L10 17L13 20"
              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="brand-name">ConvertTo<span>Tools</span>Online</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="invoice-generator.html" class="active" aria-current="page">Invoice Generator</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">Invoice Generator</span>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Business documents · Freelancer tools
      </span>

      <h1>
        Free Invoice
        <span class="gradient-text">Generator</span>
      </h1>

      <p>
        Create professional invoices and estimates without an account.
        Add your business details, client information, itemized services,
        discounts and tax, then print or save your document as a PDF.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="builder-grid" aria-label="Invoice builder">
      <section class="editor-card" aria-labelledby="editor-title">
        <div class="editor-heading">
          <h2 id="editor-title">Create your document</h2>
          <p>Your document preview updates as you edit the form.</p>
        </div>

        <form id="invoiceForm" novalidate>
          <h3 class="section-heading">1. Document details</h3>

          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="documentType">Document type</label>
              <select id="documentType">
                <option value="invoice">Invoice</option>
                <option value="estimate">Estimate / Quote</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="documentNumber">Document number</label>
              <input id="documentNumber" maxlength="60" value="INV-001">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="currency">Currency</label>
              <select id="currency">
                <option value="USD">USD — US Dollar</option>
                <option value="NPR">NPR — Nepalese Rupee</option>
                <option value="INR">INR — Indian Rupee</option>
                <option value="EUR">EUR — Euro</option>
                <option value="GBP">GBP — British Pound</option>
                <option value="AUD">AUD — Australian Dollar</option>
                <option value="CAD">CAD — Canadian Dollar</option>
                <option value="NGN">NGN — Nigerian Naira</option>
              </select>
              <span class="help">Currency formatting only; no exchange conversion.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="accentColor">Document accent color</label>
              <input id="accentColor" type="color" value="#3157d5">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="issueDate">Issue date</label>
              <input id="issueDate" type="date" required>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="dueDate" id="dueDateLabel">Due date</label>
              <input id="dueDate" type="date">
              <span class="help">Optional; used as the due date or quote validity date.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="section-heading">2. Your business details</h3>

          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field full">
              <label for="businessName">Business or sender name *</label>
              <input id="businessName" maxlength="120" autocomplete="organization"
                placeholder="Your business name">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="businessEmail">Business email</label>
              <input id="businessEmail" type="email" maxlength="150"
                autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="businessPhone">Phone number</label>
              <input id="businessPhone" maxlength="60"
                autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+977 ...">
            </div>

            <div class="field full">
              <label for="businessAddress">Business address</label>
              <textarea id="businessAddress" maxlength="700"
                autocomplete="street-address" placeholder="Street, city, country"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="businessTaxId">Tax / registration ID (optional)</label>
              <input id="businessTaxId" maxlength="100"
                placeholder="Tax number or registration ID">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="logoFile">Business logo (optional)</label>
              <input
                id="logoFile"
                class="hidden-file"
                type="file"
                accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"
                aria-describedby="logoHelp"
              >

              <div class="logo-upload">
                <div class="logo-thumbnail" id="logoThumbnail">Logo</div>
                <div class="logo-actions">
                  <label for="logoFile" class="button button-secondary">
                    Choose logo
                  </label>
                  <button type="button" id="removeLogo" class="button button-secondary">
                    Remove
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <span class="help" id="logoHelp">PNG, JPG or WebP; maximum 1 MiB. Processed locally.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="section-heading">3. Client information</h3>

          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field full">
              <label for="clientName">Client or customer name *</label>
              <input id="clientName" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off"
                placeholder="Customer or company name">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="clientEmail">Client email</label>
              <input id="clientEmail" type="email" maxlength="150"
                autocomplete="off" placeholder="client@example.com">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="clientTaxId">Client tax ID (optional)</label>
              <input id="clientTaxId" maxlength="100" placeholder="Optional identification">
            </div>

            <div class="field full">
              <label for="clientAddress">Client address</label>
              <textarea id="clientAddress" maxlength="700"
                placeholder="Customer address"></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="items-heading">
            <h3>4. Products and services</h3>
            <button type="button" id="addItem" class="button button-secondary">
              + Add item
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="items-table-wrap">
            <table class="items-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="col">Description</th>
                  <th scope="col">Qty</th>
                  <th scope="col">Unit price</th>
                  <th scope="col">Amount</th>
                  <th scope="col">Action</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody id="itemRows"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <p class="field-hint">
            Add up to 50 line items. Amount = quantity × unit price.
          </p>

          <h3 class="section-heading">5. Discount, tax and payment</h3>

          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="discountType">Discount type</label>
              <select id="discountType">
                <option value="percent">Percentage (%)</option>
                <option value="fixed">Fixed amount</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="discountValue" id="discountLabel">Discount (%)</label>
              <input id="discountValue" type="number" min="0" max="100"
                step="any" value="0" inputmode="decimal">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="taxRate">Tax rate (%)</label>
              <input id="taxRate" type="number" min="0" max="100"
                step="any" value="0" inputmode="decimal">
              <span class="help">Applied after the discount.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="otherCharges">Additional charges</label>
              <input id="otherCharges" type="number" min="0"
                max="1000000000000" step="any" value="0" inputmode="decimal">
              <span class="help">Shipping or other charges, if applicable.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="field full" id="paidField">
              <label for="amountPaid">Amount already paid</label>
              <input id="amountPaid" type="number" min="0"
                max="1000000000000" step="any" value="0" inputmode="decimal">
              <span class="help">
                Used for invoices only. The remaining balance is calculated automatically.
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="field full">
              <label for="paymentInstructions">Payment instructions</label>
              <textarea id="paymentInstructions" maxlength="1200"
                placeholder="Bank transfer details, payment method or instructions"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="field full">
              <label for="notes">Notes and terms</label>
              <textarea id="notes" maxlength="1800"
                placeholder="Thank you for your business. Add relevant terms or notes here."></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="button-row">
            <button type="button" id="exampleButton" class="button button-secondary">
              Load example
            </button>

            <button type="button" id="prepareButton" class="button button-primary">
              Check document
            </button>

            <button type="button" id="resetButton" class="button button-secondary">
              Reset
            </button>
          </div>

          <div id="editorFeedback" class="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section class="preview-column" aria-label="Document preview">
        <div class="preview-shell">
          <div class="preview-toolbar">
            <strong>Live document preview</strong>
            <span>Print-ready layout</span>
          </div>

          <div id="previewStatus" class="preview-status">
            Add your business and client names to enable document export.
          </div>

          <div class="preview-padding">
            <article id="invoicePaper" class="invoice-paper">
              <div class="invoice-top">
                <div class="invoice-brand-block">
                  <img id="previewLogo" class="invoice-logo" alt="Business logo" hidden>

                  <h2 id="previewBusinessName" class="invoice-seller-name">
                    Your Business
                  </h2>

                  <div id="previewBusinessDetails" class="invoice-seller-details"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="invoice-title-block">
                  <h2 id="previewDocumentTitle" class="invoice-document-title">INVOICE</h2>
                  <div class="invoice-number">
                    No. <span id="previewNumber">INV-001</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="invoice-meta">
                    Issued: <span id="previewIssueDate">—</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="invoice-meta" id="previewDueRow">
                    Due: <span id="previewDueDate">—</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="invoice-parties">
                <div>
                  <div class="invoice-party-label">Bill to</div>
                  <div id="previewClientName" class="invoice-party-name">Customer name</div>
                  <div id="previewClientDetails" class="invoice-party-details"></div>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <div class="invoice-party-label">From</div>
                  <div id="previewSenderName" class="invoice-party-name">Business name</div>
                  <div id="previewSenderDetails" class="invoice-party-details"></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <table class="invoice-items">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                    <th scope="col">Qty</th>
                    <th scope="col">Unit price</th>
                    <th scope="col">Amount</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="previewItems"></tbody>
              </table>

              <div class="invoice-totals-wrap">
                <div class="invoice-totals">
                  <div class="invoice-total-row">
                    <span>Subtotal</span>
                    <span id="previewSubtotal">—</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="invoice-total-row" id="previewDiscountRow">
                    <span id="previewDiscountLabel">Discount</span>
                    <span id="previewDiscount">—</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="invoice-total-row" id="previewTaxRow">
                    <span id="previewTaxLabel">Tax</span>
                    <span id="previewTax">—</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="invoice-total-row" id="previewChargesRow">
                    <span>Additional charges</span>
                    <span id="previewCharges">—</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="invoice-total-row grand-total">
                    <span id="previewTotalLabel">Total due</span>
                    <span id="previewTotal">—</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="invoice-total-row" id="previewPaidRow">
                    <span>Amount paid</span>
                    <span id="previewPaid">—</span>
                  </div>

                  <div class="invoice-total-row balance" id="previewBalanceRow">
                    <span>Balance due</span>
                    <span id="previewBalance">—</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <section id="previewPaymentSection" class="invoice-subsection" hidden>
                <h3>Payment instructions</h3>
                <p id="previewPayment"></p>
              </section>

              <section id="previewNotesSection" class="invoice-subsection" hidden>
                <h3>Notes and terms</h3>
                <p id="previewNotes"></p>
              </section>

              <div class="invoice-footer">
                Generated with ConvertToToolsOnline
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="button-row">
          <button type="button" id="printButton" class="button button-primary" disabled>
            Print / Save as PDF
          </button>

          <button type="button" id="downloadCSVButton" class="button button-secondary" disabled>
            Export line items CSV
          </button>

          <button type="button" id="copyButton" class="button button-secondary" disabled>
            Copy summary
          </button>
        </div>

        <div id="previewFeedback" class="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

        <p class="help" style="margin-top:12px">
          PDF saving uses your browser's print dialog. Choose “Save as PDF”
          where available. Print layout depends on your browser and printer settings.
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
      <h2 id="how-title" class="section-title">How to create an invoice online</h2>

      <p class="section-lead">
        Use this free invoice generator to prepare an itemized document for
        freelance services, digital work, consulting, small-business sales,
        or other transactions. Review the document details and payment terms
        before sending it to a customer.
      </p>

      <div class="info-grid">
        <article class="info-card">
          <div class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
              <path d="M5 4H19V20H5V4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
              <path d="M8 8H16M8 12H16M8 16H13" stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Enter invoice details</h3>
          <p>
            Add the business and customer names, document number, dates
            and optional contact information. Upload a logo when you need
            a more branded document.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="info-card">
          <div class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
              <path d="M4 5H20V19H4V5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
              <path d="M4 10H20M9 10V19" stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Itemize products and services</h3>
          <p>
            Add descriptions, quantities and unit prices. Subtotals,
            discounts, tax, additional charges and the remaining balance
            update as you edit.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="info-card">
          <div class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
              <path d="M12 3V15M7 10L12 15L17 10M5 20H19"
                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Print or save your document</h3>
          <p>
            Check the live preview and use your browser's print dialog
            to save a PDF or print a paper copy. Export your line items
            separately as CSV for a spreadsheet.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="formula-panel">
        <h3>How invoice totals are calculated</h3>

        <p>The generator uses the following calculation order:</p>

        <code class="formula">
          Subtotal = Sum of (Quantity × Unit Price) for each line item
        </code>

        <code class="formula">
          Discount = Subtotal × Discount Rate, or the chosen fixed discount
        </code>

        <code class="formula">
          Taxable amount = Subtotal − Discount
        </code>

        <code class="formula">
          Tax = Taxable Amount × Tax Rate
        </code>

        <code class="formula">
          Total = Subtotal − Discount + Tax + Additional Charges
        </code>

        <code class="formula">
          Balance due = Total − Amount already paid
        </code>

        <p>
          Tax treatment varies by jurisdiction and transaction. This tool
          applies a simple user-specified percentage to the discounted subtotal.
          It does not determine which taxes apply or whether a transaction
          qualifies for a particular exemption.
        </p>

        <p>
          The currency selector formats entered amounts; it does not perform
          exchange-rate conversion. Enter all amounts in the same currency.
          Review required invoice fields, identification numbers, tax rules
          and recordkeeping requirements that apply to your business.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="formula-panel">
        <h3>Who can use this invoice maker?</h3>
        <p>
          Freelancers can itemize design, development, writing or consulting
          work. Small businesses can list products and services. Independent
          professionals can produce estimates before work begins. The document
          is a general-purpose template, not a guarantee of compliance with
          every jurisdiction's invoicing requirements.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQs are the final main-content section -->
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="section-title">Frequently asked questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <article class="faq-item">
          <h3>Is this invoice generator free to use?</h3>
          <p>
            This browser-based tool is provided for creating and printing
            invoices and estimates. It does not require an account to use
            its on-page features. Printing or saving a PDF depends on the
            capabilities of your device and browser.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="faq-item">
          <h3>How can I save an invoice as a PDF?</h3>
          <p>
            Complete the required details and select Print / Save as PDF.
            In the print dialog, choose a PDF destination if your browser or
            device offers it. You can also select a physical printer.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I add my business logo?</h3>
          <p>
            Yes. Upload a PNG, JPEG or WebP image smaller than 1 MiB.
            The image is previewed locally in your browser and included
            in the printable document. The page's tool code does not
            upload the logo to a document-generation server.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I create an estimate instead of an invoice?</h3>
          <p>
            Yes. Choose Estimate / Quote from the document-type selector.
            The preview changes its title and validity-date label, and
            the amount-paid controls are removed from the estimate output.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I apply tax and discounts?</h3>
          <p>
            Yes. Enter a percentage or fixed discount and a tax percentage.
            The calculator applies the discount before tax, then adds any
            additional charges. Confirm that this calculation order matches
            your applicable tax treatment before issuing the document.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="faq-item">
          <h3>Does the generator remember my invoices?</h3>
