          <h3>Is this invoice guaranteed to meet my country's legal requirements?</h3>
          <p>
            No. Required invoice fields, tax calculations, numbering rules
            and recordkeeping requirements differ by jurisdiction and business
            type. Review your local requirements and add any mandatory
            information before using an invoice for an actual transaction.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="faq-item">
          <h3>Is my invoice information uploaded?</h3>
          <p>
            Invoice calculations, logo preview, and CSV generation run in
            your browser. This tool's code does not send form details to a
            document-generation server. Website hosting, analytics, or
            advertising services configured separately may have their own
            data practices.
          </p>
        </article>
